+/*
+==================
+jk2coop: Co-op menu commands
+
+coop_newgame [maxplayers] [map]
+	Start the campaign (or a map) and host it for others at once.
+
+coop_splitscreen [map]
+	Two players on this PC, side by side. Moves this game to the left half of
+	the screen, hosts the current game (or starts a new one when called from
+	the main menu) and, once the level is up, starts player 2's game on the
+	right half, connected to this one. With two controllers each player gets
+	one; with one, player 2 gets it and player 1 keeps keyboard and mouse.
+	Player 2's settings live in <homepath>/coop-p2. Closing this game closes
+	player 2's too.
+==================
+*/
+extern bool	Sys_CoopStartChild( const char *args );
